flowchart LR
    A[Trained PI-GLSTM] --> B[Test Dataset]

    B --> C[Model Inference]

    C --> D[SoH Prediction]
    C --> E[RUL Prediction]

    D --> F[Inverse Transformation]
    E --> G[Inverse Transformation]

    F --> H[SoH Evaluation]
    G --> I[RUL Evaluation]

    H --> H1[MAE]
    H --> H2[RMSE]
    H --> H3[R²]
    H --> H4[MAPE]
    H --> H5[Monotonicity]

    I --> I1[MAE]
    I --> I2[RMSE]
    I --> I3[R²]
    I --> I4[MAPE]

    H --> J[Comparative Analysis]
    I --> J

    A --> K[Saved Model Weights]

    K --> L[Streamlit Application]

    L --> M[User Input]
    M --> N[Preprocessing]
    N --> O[PI-GLSTM Inference]

    O --> P[SoH Dashboard]
    O --> Q[RUL Dashboard]
    O --> R[Prediction Visualisation]